      "GmdIndex" : 26,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I see...\nSo, even though you’re an Arisen,\nyou’re trying to master the art of alchemy, \nonce sealed away by the White Dragon.",
        "Jp" : "ほほう――\n君は白竜がかつて封じた錬金術を\n覚者でありながら、究めようというんだね"
