      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Now, building on what you’ve learned so far, \nwhat I’m about to teach you is the advanced section.\nWe’ll delve deeper into logic and explore the essence\nof attributes and matter—the very essence of the elixir.",
